{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01006",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 3.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting, come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.44,
      "end_seconds": 7.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.48,
      "end_seconds": 9.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.98,
      "end_seconds": 16.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a long seizure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.17,
      "end_seconds": 24.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Alright, when did this begin? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.73,
      "end_seconds": 35.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.93,
      "text": "Uh, for ten days, I'd say. And being drowsy and confused afterwards, too. I've also been biting my tongue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.31,
      "end_seconds": 40.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.45,
      "end_seconds": 45.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Actually, you know, my mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.51,
      "end_seconds": 49.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.18,
      "end_seconds": 61.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.49,
      "text": "I've had epilepsy, yes. Acid reflux, for nearly five years. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.75,
      "end_seconds": 69.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Alright, epilepsy, that matches what I have here. Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.21,
      "end_seconds": 76.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "I had my appendix taken out when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.75,
      "end_seconds": 81.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.63,
      "end_seconds": 86.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.04,
      "end_seconds": 90.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.98,
      "end_seconds": 95.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.38,
      "end_seconds": 98.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.19,
      "end_seconds": 103.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.85,
      "end_seconds": 125.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.39,
      "end_seconds": 129.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.19,
      "end_seconds": 133.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.6,
      "end_seconds": 148.14,
      "duration_seconds": 13.54,
      "text": "Mm, um, it's lamotrigine, 100 milligrams, twice a day for the fits. So, I take pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.44,
      "end_seconds": 165.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Any head injury or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.38,
      "end_seconds": 171.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "No head injury or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.52,
      "end_seconds": 175.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.26,
      "end_seconds": 181.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Well, that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.35,
      "end_seconds": 186.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.63,
      "end_seconds": 201.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.34,
      "end_seconds": 229.15,
      "duration_seconds": 10.81,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse is 119 beats a minute, respiratory rate 20, blood pressure 130 over 76, temperature is 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.03,
      "end_seconds": 234.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Ah, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.71,
      "end_seconds": 240.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Right, they help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.93,
      "end_seconds": 245.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.8,
      "end_seconds": 249.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.72,
      "end_seconds": 268.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "You are drowsy and confused, and there is blood on your tongue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.07,
      "end_seconds": 273.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.7,
      "end_seconds": 297.45,
      "duration_seconds": 15.75,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, it's hard to say. A prolonged seizure in a person with epilepsy is one possibility and a missed dose of medicine another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.62,
      "end_seconds": 300.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.48,
      "end_seconds": 329.6,
      "duration_seconds": 27.12,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a prolonged seizure in a person with epilepsy, and we'll know more once the a blood sugar is back. I want a blood sugar done, that's for seizure. You'll be taking lorazepam, 4 milligrams, once now, single dose. That should help with prolonged seizure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.23,
      "end_seconds": 331.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.38,
      "end_seconds": 355.44,
      "duration_seconds": 22.06,
      "text": "Lie on your side while we monitor you. I'll also refer you to the emergency team. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. We'll catch up straight away. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.48,
      "end_seconds": 366.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "So, I take the lorazepam, 4 milligrams, once now and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.64,
      "end_seconds": 377.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.64,
      "end_seconds": 380.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.15,
      "end_seconds": 383.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}